# 跨平台仓库：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 检出 CRLF 造成无谓 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.aab binary
*.apk binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF，PowerShell 5.1 对此更稳
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 生成物不参与 diff 统计
docs/diagram/*.svg generated
Cargo.lock text
pnpm-lock.yaml text -diff linguist-generated
